Rock Subscribers
Rock Deliveries
Rock Histories

Subscribe takes Name
Put Subscribers at Name into Active
If Active is 1
Give back "rejected"
Else
Subscribers at Name is 1
Put Deliveries at Name into Count
If Count is mysterious
Deliveries at Name is 0
Histories at Name is ""
Yeah
Give back "accepted"
Yeah
Yeah

Unsubscribe takes Name
Put Subscribers at Name into Active
If Active is 1
Subscribers at Name is 0
Give back "accepted"
Else
Give back "rejected"
Yeah
Yeah

Publish takes Event
For Active and Name of Subscribers
If Active is 1
Put Deliveries at Name into Count
Put Count plus 1 into NextCount
Put NextCount into Deliveries at Name
Put Histories at Name into History
If Count is 0
Put Event into Histories at Name
Else
Put History plus "," into Prefix
Put Prefix plus Event into Histories at Name
Yeah
Yeah
Yeah
Give back "published"
Yeah

Call Subscribe with "audit" into AuditSubscribe
Call Subscribe with "dashboard" into DashboardSubscribe
Call Subscribe with "audit" into Duplicate
Call Publish with "draft" into FirstPublish
Call Unsubscribe with "dashboard" into FirstUnsubscribe
Call Unsubscribe with "dashboard" into SecondUnsubscribe
Call Publish with "published" into SecondPublish

Put Histories at "audit" into AuditHistory
Put Histories at "dashboard" into DashboardHistory
Put "observer=audit:" plus AuditHistory into Summary
Put Summary plus ";dashboard:" into Summary
Put Summary plus DashboardHistory into Summary
Put Summary plus ";duplicate=" into Summary
Put Summary plus Duplicate into Summary
Put Summary plus ";second-unsubscribe=" into Summary
Put Summary plus SecondUnsubscribe into Summary
Print Summary
